# Environment Variables (MCT Security Stack)

Copy to .env and populate with real values. NEVER commit .env.

```bash
# --- Wazuh stack ---
WAZUH_STACK_ROOT=/opt/wazuh-docker/multi-node
WAZUH_ADMIN_PASSWORD=            # indexer admin (also in compose)
WAZUH_REGISTRATION_PASSWORD=     # agent enrollment password

# --- PVE / lab ---
PVE_HOST=                        # e.g. 192.168.222.187
PVE_USERNAME=root
PVE_PASSWORD=
PVE222_API_TOKEN=                # root@pam!token=secret

# --- DigitalOcean Spaces ---
DO_SPACES_BUCKET=wazuh
DO_SPACES_BUCKET_NAME=wazuh
DO_SPACES_ENDPOINT=              # https://<region>.digitaloceanspaces.com
DO_SPACES_ACCESS_KEY=
DO_SPACES_SECRET_KEY=

# --- Cloudflare ---
CF_TUNNEL_TOKEN=                 # in .env.cloudflare

# --- Security Onion ---
SO_SSH_USERNAME=user
SO_SSH_PASSWORD=

# --- Kestrel GitHub App broker (replaces GH_PAT) ---
KESTREL_BROKER_URL=http://192.168.222.225:8090
KESTREL_GITHUB_APP=              # owner-gated broker alias, not a PAT
KESTREL_BROKER_TOKEN_FILE=/etc/soc/kestrel-broker-token-github
# KESTREL_GITHUB_TOKEN_CACHE=/run/soc/kestrel-github-token-<alias>.json

# --- Misc ---
SUDO_PASSWORD=
VIRUSTOTAL_API_KEY=
```

See config/examples/secrets.example.env for the full placeholder set.
